// spar-args: a command line argument parser for Spar.
//
// Spar has no re-exports, so import what you need from its own file:
//
//   config/cli.spar        Cli                      the root definition
//   config/command.spar    SubCommand               a flat list; nesting is `path`
//   config/option.spar     ArgOption                takes a value
//   config/flag.spar       Flag, FlagAction         switch, negated switch or counter
//   config/positional.spar Positional
//   config/choice.spar     Choice                   allowed values and their aliases
//   config/group.spar      ArgGroup                 at-least / at-most rules
//   config/value_spec.spar ValueSpec, ValueKind, ValueCollection
//   config/help.spar       HelpConfig
//   config/settings.spar   CliSettings
//   parser/parser.spar     parse, parseProgramArgs, parseOrExit
//   result/matches.spar    Matches                  typed getters
//   result/parse_error.spar ParseError, ParseErrorKind
//   help/renderer.spar     renderHelp
//   help/usage.spar        renderUsage
//
// See examples/ for complete programs.
